  "Software Details": "Подробности программного обеспечения",
  "The Additional Custom Field module in eCommerceGo SAAS empowers businesses to enrich their products with customized fields, enabling them to gather precise and relevant information. This module is particularly beneficial for industries such as spas, clinics, or other appointment-based services where capturing detailed client information is essential. By leveraging this feature, admins can create tailored data fields that enhance the overall product configuration and booking experience, ensuring that the collected information aligns with their specific business needs": "Модуль дополнительных настраиваемых полей в eCommerceGo SAAS позволяет компаниям дополнять свои продукты настраиваемыми полями, что позволяет им собирать точную и актуальную информацию. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Посмотреть живую демонстрацию",
  "Enabling the Additional Custom Field Feature": "Включение функции дополнительного настраиваемого поля",
  "Before utilizing the Additional Custom Field module, administrators must enable its functionality within the eCommerceGo SAAS settings. This critical step unlocks the module's tools, allowing admins to define and add custom fields. Activation is simple: navigate to the settings menu, locate the Additional Custom Field toggle, and switch it on. Once enabled, admins can customize fields for each product, paving the way for more detailed information capture during product creation and configuration.": "Прежде чем использовать модуль «Дополнительное настраиваемое поле», администраторы должны включить его функциональность в настройках eCommerceGo SAAS. ",
  "Adding Custom Fields for Products": "Добавление пользовательских полей для продуктов",
  "With the feature activated, administrators can introduce custom fields while creating or editing a product. These fields allow for capturing specific data that might be unique to a business's operation, such as client preferences, additional instructions, or service-specific details. Custom fields can include text inputs, dropdown menus, or checkboxes, offering flexibility in data collection. Once defined during product creation, these fields become an integral part of the product details and ensure that all necessary information is gathered upfront.": "Если эта функция активирована, администраторы могут вводить настраиваемые поля при создании или редактировании продукта. ",
  "Enhancing Product Details with Custom Fields": "Улучшение сведений о продукте с помощью настраиваемых полей",
  "The Additional Custom Field module is designed to optimize the administrative process of product configuration. By allowing admins to input additional field values during product creation, the module ensures that relevant details are automatically included in the Additional Custom Field page. This centralized repository of information reduces manual data entry and ensures consistency across records. The enhanced product details streamline internal workflows and improve communication between admins and their customers.": "Модуль «Дополнительное настраиваемое поле» предназначен для оптимизации административного процесса настройки продукта. ",
  "Benefits of Streamlined Data Collection": "Преимущества упрощенного сбора данных",
